(454,13,1,'possible','possible','possible','medium','{\"strengths\":[\"Currently enrolled DNSC student\"],\"concerns\":[\"Unpublished GWA cut-off\"],\"reminders\":[\"Check with the DNSC Scholarship and Grants Unit for GWA cut-offs\",\"Prepare your Certificate of Registration and latest grades\"]}',69,'[{\"key\":\"dnsc\",\"label\":\"DNSC student (current or incoming)\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"Your BAKR account is for a DNSC student.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"enrolled\",\"label\":\"Currently enrolled or enrolling\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"Your answer: Currently enrolled.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"gwa\",\"label\":\"Meets the academic (GWA) requirement\",\"result\":\"confirm\",\"detail\":\"Set by the DNSC Scholarship and Grants Unit. It is not published in the sources BAKR uses.\",\"required\":true}]','You may qualify for the DNSC Academic Scholarship based on your enrollment status and good grades. Since the specific GWA cut-off is not published, you need to confirm with the financial aid office to see if you meet their academic requirements.','gemini','2026-11-19 07:01:45','2026-11-19 07:01:28','2026-11-19 07:01:45'),
(455,13,2,'possible','possible','possible','medium','{\"strengths\":[\"Has a skill in music\",\"Currently enrolled DNSC student\"],\"concerns\":[\"No awards or achievements provided\"],\"reminders\":[\"Prepare proof of your musical talent\",\"Ask the scholarship unit about talent audition requirements\"]}',71,'[{\"key\":\"dnsc\",\"label\":\"DNSC student (current or incoming)\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"Your BAKR account is for a DNSC student.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"enrolled\",\"label\":\"Currently enrolled or enrolling\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"Your answer: Currently enrolled.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"talent\",\"label\":\"Has a skill in music, dance, arts, or sports\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"You selected: Music.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"awards\",\"label\":\"Has awards or achievements to show\",\"result\":\"fail\",\"detail\":\"Your answer: No.\",\"required\":false}]','You meet the basic talent requirement since you play music. However, because you do not have formal awards or achievements listed, you should check with the scholarship unit if a live audition can substitute.','gemini','2026-11-19 07:01:45','2026-11-19 07:01:28','2026-11-19 07:01:45'),
(456,13,3,'not_eligible','not_eligible','not_eligible','low','{\"strengths\":[\"Currently enrolled DNSC student\"],\"concerns\":[\"Not an SSC officer or student publication member\"],\"reminders\":[]}',33,'[{\"key\":\"dnsc\",\"label\":\"DNSC student (current or incoming)\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"Your BAKR account is for a DNSC student.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"enrolled\",\"label\":\"Currently enrolled\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"Your answer: Currently enrolled.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"leader\",\"label\":\"Student Supreme Council officer or Student Publication Editorial Board member\",\"result\":\"fail\",\"detail\":\"None of the qualifying options were selected.\",\"required\":true}]','This grant is strictly reserved for Student Supreme Council officers and Student Publication Editorial Board members. Since you do not hold these leadership positions, you are not eligible.','gemini','2026-11-19 07:01:45','2026-11-19 07:01:28','2026-11-19 07:01:45'),
