ean\'s recommendation show this.\",\"required\":false}]','You are not eligible because you are in your second year (not 1st, 3rd, or 4th year), do not come from an agrarian reform or farming family, and have a failing grade.','gemini','2026-11-19 20:57:17','2026-11-19 20:57:08','2026-11-19 20:57:17'),
