(503,16,8,'eligible','eligible','eligible','high','{\"strengths\":[\"High Grade 12 average of 95.5%\",\"Income within the allowed limit\",\"Enrolled in a priority program\"],\"concerns\":[],\"reminders\":[\"Complete Annex A application form\",\"Prepare certified copy of Form 138\"]}',100,'[{\"key\":\"citizen\",\"label\":\"Filipino citizen\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"Your answer: Filipino citizen.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"first_year\",\"label\":\"Incoming or current first-year college student\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"Your answer: 1st year.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"gwa\",\"label\":\"Grade 12 GWA of at least 93%\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"You entered 95.5%. The minimum is 93%.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"income\",\"label\":\"Combined parent \\/ guardian gross income of \\u20b1500,000 or less\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"Your income range (Up to \\u20b1300,000) is within the limit.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"no_other\",\"label\":\"Not already getting another national government-funded scholarship or grant, including TES or TDP (one-time grants do not count)\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"You do not receive a conflicting scholarship.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"no_degree\",\"label\":\"Has not finished an undergraduate degree (no second-course takers)\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"Your answer: No.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"no_credited_units\",\"label\":\"Not a transferee or shiftee with credited college units\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"Your answer: No.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"ph_shs\",\"label\":\"Graduated from a senior high school in the Philippines\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"Your answer: Yes, in the Philippines.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"priority\",\"label\":\"Enrolled in a CHED priority program with CHED recognition (non-priority programs cannot apply)\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"Your program (Bachelor of Science in Information Technology) is on the provider\'s list.\",\"required\":true}]','You may qualify for this merit scholarship because your Grade 12 average exceeds the 93% minimum and your family income is within the limit. Gather your report card and income proofs.','gemini','2026-11-19 21:16:34','2026-11-19 21:16:26','2026-11-19 21:16:34'),
(504,16,9,'eligible','eligible','eligible','high','{\"strengths\":[\"Top 5 of graduating class\",\"Grade 12 average above 95%\",\"Special equity group priority\"],\"concerns\":[],\"reminders\":[\"Apply via the official BPMSP online portal\",\"Prepare proof of being a solo parent dependent\"]}',100,'[{\"key\":\"citizen\",\"label\":\"Filipino citizen (foreign or dual citizens cannot apply)\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"Your answer: Filipino citizen.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"first_year\",\"label\":\"Incoming first-year college student (not repeating or re-entering first year)\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"Your answer: Incoming first-year (not yet started).\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"merit\",\"label\":\"Top 5 of the graduating class, or a Grade 12 GWA of at least 95%\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"Top 5 of the graduating class: yes.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"no_units\",\"label\":\"No college units earned before (including transferees or shiftees with credited units)\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"Your answer: No.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"no_degree\",\"label\":\"Has not completed an undergraduate degree\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"Your answer: No.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"income\",\"label\":\"Combined parent \\/ guardian gross income of \\u20b12,000,000 or less\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"Your income range (Up to \\u20b1300,000) is within the limit.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"no_other\",\"label\":\"Not already getting a national government-funded scholarship or grant (private, LGU and one-time local grants do not count)\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"You do not receive a conflicting scholarship.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"no_discipline\",\"label\":\"No pending case or record of disciplinary action in school\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"Your answer: No.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"program\",\"label\":\"Enrolling in a CHED priority program\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"Your program (Bachelor of Science in Information Technology) is on the provider\'s list.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"equity\",\"label\":\"Special equity group (10 extra ranking points): Indigenous Peoples, PWD, solo parent or dependent, living in poverty, or first-generation student\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"You selected: I am a child of a solo parent.\",\"required\":false}]','Looks like a strong match because you graduated in the Top 5 with a high average and qualify for equity points as a solo parent dependent. Submit your online application early.','gemini','2026-11-19 21:16:34','2026-11-19 21:16:26','2026-11-19 21:16:34'),
(505,16,10,'eligible','eligible','eligible','high','{\"strengths\":[\"Grade 12 grade above 90%\",\"Enrolling in a STEM program\",\"No disciplinary record\"],\"concerns\":[],\"reminders\":[\"Prepare your Grade 12 report card\",\"Secure a Certificate of Good Moral Standing\"]}',100,'[{\"key\":\"citizen\",\"label\":\"Filipino citizen\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"Your answer: Filipino citizen.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"first_year\",\"label\":\"Incoming first-year college student\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"Your answer: 1st year.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"gwa\",\"label\":\"Grade 12 grade of at least 90%\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"You entered 95.5%. The minimum is 90%.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"none_other\",\"label\":\"No other scholarship or educational assistance\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"You do not receive a conflicting scholarship.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"course\",\"label\":\"A 3- to 4-year Business, STEM (not medical) or Sustainability program\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"Your program (Bachelor of Science in Information Technology) is on the provider\'s list.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"conduct\",\"label\":\"No disciplinary sanction in senior high school\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"Your answer: No.\",\"required\":true}]','You meet all published requirements for this full-ride scholarship, including your high grades and enrollment in an IT program. Prepare your report card and moral character certificate.','gemini','2026-11-19 21:16:34','2026-11-19 21:16:26','2026-11-19 21:16:34'),
