ogram (Bachelor of Science in Information Technology) is on the provider\'s list.\",\"required\":true},{\"key\":\"equity\",\"label\":\"Special equity group (10 extra ranking points): Indigenous Peoples, PWD, solo parent or dependent, living in poverty, or first-generation student\",\"result\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"You selected: I am the first in my family to go to college.\",\"required\":false}]','You are not eligible for this program because the Higher Education Track requires applicants to be incoming first-year college students rather than second-year students.','gemini','2026-11-21 02:24:57','2026-11-21 02:24:44','2026-11-21 02:24:57'),
