 Education - Science\"]}],\"renewal_requirements\":[\"Certified true copy of the Certificate of Registration \\/ Enrollment (COR \\/ COE)\",\"Certified true copy of grades showing the GWA of the previous semester\",\"HEI certification that you do not receive another national government-funded scholarship (every start of the academic year)\"]}',1,'2026-11-18 22:52:07'),
(4,9,NULL,'{\"official_url\":\"https:\\/\\/bpms.ched.gov.ph\\/\",\"overview\":\"A merit-based CHED scholarship for academically talented Filipino senior high school graduates whose parents or guardians earn \\u20b12,000,000 a year or less. Higher Education Track: incoming first-year students in the Top 5 of their class or with a GWA of at least 95%, enrolling in a CHED priority program. CHEDRO ranks applicants by GWA (70%) and family income (30%), plus 10 points for special equity groups.\",\"benefits\":[\"State colleges like DNSC: tuition and other school fees under Free Higher Education\",\"Stipend and allowance: \\u20b145,000 per academic year (\\u20b122,500 per semester)\",\"Academic Excellence Incentive: \\u20b118,000 per term for the top 15 scholars per region\",\"Until you finish the degree program, as long as you pass all subjects every semester\",\"Amounts may be adjusted depending on available funds and Commission En Banc approval\"],\"documents\":[\"Application form, filled in on the official BPMSP online portal (Annex A for applicants from GIDCAs)\",\"PSA birth certificate\",\"Certified true copy of Form 138 \\/ SF9, signed by your senior high school registrar\",\"Proof of income, any one: BIR Certificate of Tax Exemption \\/ Non-Filer; DSWD or C\\/MSWDO certificate for 4Ps beneficiaries; latest ITR (BIR Form 1701) or BIR Form 2316 of both parents or guardians, or of the applicant; or certified latest contract or proof of income (children of OFWs and seafarers)\",\"College admission slip or proof of admission\",\"Parent \\/ Legal Guardian Consent Form (Annex L), if applicable\",\"Certified certificate from your senior high school that you were in the Top 5 of your graduating class, if applicable\",\"Proof of a special equity group, if applicable: PWD ID or PDAO certification; Solo Parent ID (yours or your parent\'s); Senior Citizen ID; Social Case Study for first-generation students; or NCIP certification for Indigenous Peoples\"],\"application_route\":\"CHED and DepEd announce the call for applications. Apply on the official BPMSP online portal; it is coursed through the CHED Regional Office where your college is (CHEDRO XI for DNSC). CHEDRO shortlists and ranks applicants, checks that you are enrolled in a priority program, and issues a Notice of Award. Accept it within 15 days. If you qualify for two national government scholarships, you must choose one.\",\"window_note\":\"CHED and DepEd announce one call each academic year on the BPMSP portal. If you apply before you are admitted, you get one month from the start of the semester to submit proof of enrollment.\",\"rules\":[{\"key\":\"citizen\",\"label\":\"Filipino citizen (foreign or dual citizens cannot apply)\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"citizenship\",\"value\":\"filipino\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":2,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"first_year\",\"label\":\"Incoming first-year college student (not repeating or re-entering first year)\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"year_level\",\"value\":1,\"required\":true,\"weight\":3,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"merit\",\"label\":\"Top 5 of the graduating class, or a Grade 12 GWA of at least 95%\",\"type\":\"any_of\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":5,\"src\":\"web\",\"rules\":[{\"key\":\"top5\",\"label\":\"Top 5 of the graduating class\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"top_five\",\"value\":\"yes\"},{\"key\":\"gwa95\",\"label\":\"Grade 12 GWA of at least 95%\",\"type\":\"gte\",\"fact\":\"shs_gwa_percent\",\"value\":95}]},{\"key\":\"no_units\",\"label\":\"No college units earned before (including transferees or shiftees with credited units)\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"previous_units\",\"value\":\"no\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":2,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"no_degree\",\"label\":\"Has not completed an undergraduate degree\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"previous_degree\",\"value\":\"no\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":2,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"income\",\"label\":\"Combined parent \\/ guardian gross income of \\u20b12,000,000 or less\",\"type\":\"income_lte\",\"fact\":\"income\",\"value\":2000000,\"required\":true,\"weight\":3,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"no_other\",\"label\":\"Not already getting a national government-funded scholarship or grant (private, LGU and one-time local grants do not count)\",\"type\":\"contains_none\",\"fact\":\"existing_assistance\",\"value\":[\"tes_tdp_ched\",\"other_government\"],\"required\":true,\"weight\":3,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"no_discipline\",\"label\":\"No pending case or record of disciplinary action in school\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"disciplinary\",\"value\":\"no\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":2,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"program\",\"label\":\"Enrolling in a CHED priority program\",\"type\":\"confirm\",\"fact\":\"program_field\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":3,\"src\":\"web\",\"confirm_note\":\"Priority domains: Agriculture and Fisheries; Creative Industries; Healthcare and Allied Programs; Engineering and Technology; Financial Services; Teacher Education; Digital Technology; Science and Mathematics. Ask CHEDRO XI or DNSC whether your program is on the current list.\"},{\"key\":\"equity\",\"label\":\"Special equity group (10 extra ranking points): Indigenous Peoples, PWD, solo parent or dependent, living in poverty, or first-generation student\",\"type\":\"contains_any\",\"fact\":\"special_groups\",\"value\":[\"indigenous_people\",\"pwd\",\"solo_parent\",\"listahanan\",\"four_ps\",\"first_generation\"],\"required\":false,\"weight\":2,\"src\":\"web\"}],\"renewal_requirements\":[{\"name\":\"Certified true copy of the Certificate of Registration \\/ Enrollment (COR \\/ COE)\",\"note\":null,\"types\":[\"pdf\",\"jpg\",\"png\"],\"max_mb\":5,\"required\":true},{\"name\":\"Certified true copy of grades showing the GWA of the previous semester\",\"note\":null,\"types\":[\"pdf\",\"jpg\",\"png\"],\"max_mb\":5,\"required\":true},{\"name\":\"HEI certification that you do not receive another nationally funded scholarship (every start of the academic year)\",\"note\":null,\"types\":[\"pdf\",\"jpg\",\"png\"],\"max_mb\":5,\"required\":true}]}','{\"official_url\":\"https:\\/\\/bpms.ched.gov.ph\\/\",\"overview\":\"A merit-based CHED scholarship for academically talented Filipino senior high school graduates whose parents or guardians earn \\u20b12,000,000 a year or less. Higher Education Track: incoming first-year students in the Top 5 of their class or with a GWA of at least 95%, enrolling in a CHED priority program. CHEDRO ranks applicants by GWA (70%) and family income (30%), plus 10 points for special equity groups.\",\"benefits\":[\"State colleges like DNSC: tuition and other school fees under Free Higher Education\",\"Stipend and allowance: \\u20b145,000 per academic year (\\u20b122,500 per semester)\",\"Academic Excellence Incentive: \\u20b118,000 per term for the top 15 scholars per region\",\"Until you finish the degree program, as long as you pass all subjects every semester\",\"Amounts may be adjusted depending on available funds and Commission En Banc approval\"],\"documents\":[\"Application form, filled in on the official BPMSP online portal (Annex A for applicants from GIDCAs)\",\"PSA birth certificate\",\"Certified true copy of Form 138 \\/ SF9, signed by your senior high school registrar\",\"Proof of income, any one: BIR Certificate of Tax Exemption \\/ Non-Filer; DSWD or C\\/MSWDO certificate for 4Ps beneficiaries; latest ITR (BIR Form 1701) or BIR Form 2316 of both parents or guardians, or of the applicant; or certified latest contract or proof of income (children of OFWs and seafarers)\",\"College admission slip or proof of admission\",\"Parent \\/ Legal Guardian Consent Form (Annex L), if applicable\",\"Certified certificate from your senior high school that you were in the Top 5 of your graduating class, if applicable\",\"Proof of a special equity group, if applicable: PWD ID or PDAO certification; Solo Parent ID (yours or your parent\'s); Senior Citizen ID; Social Case Study for first-generation students; or NCIP certification for Indigenous Peoples\"],\"application_route\":\"CHED and DepEd announce the call for applications. Apply on the official BPMSP online portal; it is coursed through the CHED Regional Office where your college is (CHEDRO XI for DNSC). CHEDRO shortlists and ranks applicants, checks that you are enrolled in a priority program, and issues a Notice of Award. Accept it within 15 days. If you qualify for two national government scholarships, you must choose one.\",\"window_note\":\"CHED and DepEd announce one call each academic year on the BPMSP portal. If you apply before you are admitted, you get one month from the start of the semester to submit proof of enrollment.\",\"rules\":[{\"key\":\"citizen\",\"label\":\"Filipino citizen (foreign or dual citizens cannot apply)\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"citizenship\",\"value\":\"filipino\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":2,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"first_year\",\"label\":\"Incoming first-year college student (not repeating or re-entering first year)\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"enrollment_status\",\"value\":\"incoming_first_year\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":3,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"merit\",\"label\":\"Top 5 of the graduating class, or a Grade 12 GWA of at least 95%\",\"type\":\"any_of\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":5,\"src\":\"web\",\"rules\":[{\"key\":\"top5\",\"label\":\"Top 5 of the graduating class\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"top_five\",\"value\":\"yes\"},{\"key\":\"gwa95\",\"label\":\"Grade 12 GWA of at least 95%\",\"type\":\"gte\",\"fact\":\"shs_gwa_percent\",\"value\":95}]},{\"key\":\"no_units\",\"label\":\"No college units earned before (including transferees or shiftees with credited units)\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"previous_units\",\"value\":\"no\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":2,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"no_degree\",\"label\":\"Has not completed an undergraduate degree\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"previous_degree\",\"value\":\"no\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":2,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"income\",\"label\":\"Combined parent \\/ guardian gross income of \\u20b12,000,000 or less\",\"type\":\"income_lte\",\"fact\":\"income\",\"value\":2000000,\"required\":true,\"weight\":3,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"no_other\",\"label\":\"Not already getting a national government-funded scholarship or grant (private, LGU and one-time local grants do not count)\",\"type\":\"contains_none\",\"fact\":\"existing_assistance\",\"value\":[\"tes_tdp_ched\",\"other_government\"],\"required\":true,\"weight\":3,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"no_discipline\",\"label\":\"No pending case or record of disciplinary action in school\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"disciplinary\",\"value\":\"no\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":2,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"program\",\"label\":\"Enrolling in a CHED priority program\",\"type\":\"program_in\",\"fact\":\"program_name\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":3,\"src\":\"web\",\"open_list\":true,\"confirm_note\":\"Your program is not named in CHED\'s national priority list that BAKR uses (CMO No. 7, s. 2023). CHED may have newer or regional priorities and CHEDRO XI decides, so ask CHEDRO XI or the DNSC Scholarship and Grants Unit.\",\"pass\":[\"Bachelor of Science in Information Technology\",\"Bachelor of Science in Agro-Forestry\",\"Bachelor of Science in Marine Biology\",\"Bachelor of Science in Social Work\",\"Bachelor of Science in Tourism Management\",\"Bachelor of Secondary Education - Mathematics\",\"Bachelor of Secondary Education - Science\"]},{\"key\":\"equity\",\"label\":\"Special equity group (10 extra ranking points): Indigenous Peoples, PWD, solo parent or dependent, living in poverty, or first-generation student\",\"type\":\"contains_any\",\"fact\":\"special_groups\",\"value\":[\"indigenous_people\",\"pwd\",\"solo_parent\",\"listahanan\",\"four_ps\",\"first_generation\"],\"required\":false,\"bonus\":true,\"weight\":2,\"src\":\"web\"}],\"renewal_requirements\":[\"Certified true copy of the Certificate of Registration \\/ Enrollment (COR \\/ COE)\",\"Certified true copy of grades showing the GWA of the previous semester\",\"HEI certification that you do not receive another nationally funded scholarship (every start of the academic year)\"]}',1,'2026-11-18 22:52:07'),
(5,7,NULL,'{\"official_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.science-scholarships.ph\\/\",\"overview\":\"A DOST-SEI scholarship for talented Filipino students entering priority Science and Technology programs. Two tracks: the Merit Scholarship (formerly NSDB \\/ NSTA) for students with high aptitude in science and mathematics, and the RA 7687 Scholarship for students whose families\' socio-economic status does not exceed DOST\'s set values. Scholars may study at state colleges like DNSC.\",\"benefits\":[\"Tuition and other school fees: actual fees up to \\u20b140,000 a year (for scholars in private schools)\",\"Learning materials and \\/ or connectivity allowance: \\u20b110,000 a year\",\"Monthly living allowance: \\u20b18,000 a month\",\"Clothing allowance: \\u20b11,000 (first semester of first year only)\",\"Transportation: one economy-class round trip a year, if you study outside your home province\",\"Group accident and health insurance\",\"Thesis allowance: \\u20b110,000\",\"Research dissemination grant: up to \\u20b150,000 (applied for by the scholar, subject to approval)\",\"Graduation allowance: \\u20b11,000\",\"Mid-year term, if your curriculum requires it: fees up to \\u20b110,000, \\u20b12,000 learning materials, and \\u20b18,000 a month\"],\"documents\":[\"Form C \\u2013 Certificate of Good Moral Character\",\"Form D \\u2013 Certificate of Good Health\",\"Form E \\u2013 Principal\'s Certification: E1 Grade 12 STEM strand; E2 Grade 12 non-STEM strand in the upper 5% of the class; E3 homeschool; E4 Alternative Learning System\",\"Form F \\u2013 Certificate of Residency\",\"Form G \\u2013 Parent\'s Certification that you have no pending immigration application to another country\",\"Form H \\u2013 DOST-SEI Scholarship Examination \\/ Award\",\"Form I \\u2013 Applicant\'s Certification of No Post-Secondary Units\",\"Form J \\u2013 Signed Declaration of Applicant and Parent \\/ Legal Guardian\",\"Recent passport-size picture (4.5 cm \\u00d7 3.5 cm)\",\"Birth certificate\",\"One proof of income of your parents, guardian or spouse: 2024 Income Tax Return; BIR Form 1701; OFW employment contract; BIR Certificate of Exemption from Filing of ITR; Certificate of Indigency; Certificate of Employment with Compensation; or proof of pension\",\"Notarized Affidavit of Guardianship, if applicable\",\"Marriage certificate, if married\"],\"application_route\":\"Apply online through the DOST-SEI scholarship site (science-scholarships.ph), where the forms are posted, then take the DOST-SEI Scholarship Examination. Qualifiers enroll in a priority S&T program at the University of the Philippines, a state college such as DNSC, or a private school that is a CHED Center of Excellence \\/ Development or has FAAP Level III accreditation.\",\"window_note\":\"For Grade 12 students graduating in SY 2025\\u20132026, and earlier Grade 12 graduates not yet enrolled in college. Watch science-scholarships.ph for the call and exam schedule.\",\"rules\":[{\"key\":\"citizen\",\"label\":\"Natural-born Filipino citizen\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"citizenship\",\"value\":\"filipino\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":2,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"incoming\",\"label\":\"Graduating from Grade 12, or a Grade 12 graduate not yet enrolled in college\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"enrollment_status\",\"value\":\"incoming_first_year\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":3,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"strand\",\"label\":\"STEM strand graduate, or in the top 5% of a non-STEM graduating class\",\"type\":\"confirm\",\"fact\":\"shs_gwa_percent\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":3,\"src\":\"web\",\"confirm_note\":\"Your principal certifies this on Form E (E1 for STEM, E2 for non-STEM top 5%; E3 homeschool; E4 ALS).\"},{\"key\":\"course\",\"label\":\"Enrolling in a DOST-SEI priority S&T program\",\"type\":\"program_in\",\"fact\":\"program_name\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":5,\"src\":\"web\",\"pass\":[\"Bachelor of Science in Agro-Forestry\",\"Bachelor of Science in Fisheries and Aquatic Sciences\",\"Bachelor of Science in Food Technology\",\"Bachelor of Science in Information Systems\",\"Bachelor of Science in Information Technology\",\"Bachelor of Science in Marine Biology\",\"Bachelor of Secondary Education - Mathematics\",\"Bachelor of Secondary Education - Science\"],\"maybe\":[\"Bachelor of Technology and Livelihood Education\"],\"not\":[\"Bachelor of Arts in Communication\",\"Bachelor of Physical Education\",\"Bachelor of Public Administration\",\"Bachelor of Science in Criminology\",\"Bachelor of Science in Disaster Resilience and Management\",\"Bachelor of Science in Entrepreneurship\",\"Bachelor of Science in Social Work\",\"Bachelor of Science in Tourism Management\",\"Bachelor of Secondary Education - English\"]},{\"key\":\"no_units\",\"label\":\"Has not earned any post-secondary (college or vocational) units\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"previous_units\",\"value\":\"no\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":2,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"exam\",\"label\":\"DOST-SEI Scholarship Examination taken or passed (selection is by this exam)\",\"type\":\"in\",\"fact\":\"dost_exam\",\"value\":[\"taken_waiting\",\"passed\"],\"required\":false,\"weight\":3,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"ra7687\",\"label\":\"RA 7687 track only: family income within DOST\'s set values, and living in your municipality for at least 4 years\",\"type\":\"confirm\",\"fact\":\"income_max\",\"required\":false,\"weight\":1,\"src\":\"web\",\"confirm_note\":\"The Merit track has no income or residency requirement. For RA 7687, DOST-SEI checks your proof of income and your barangay\'s certificate of residency.\"}]}','{\"official_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.science-scholarships.ph\\/\",\"overview\":\"A DOST-SEI scholarship for talented Filipino students entering priority Science and Technology programs. Two tracks: the Merit Scholarship (formerly NSDB \\/ NSTA) for students with high aptitude in science and mathematics, and the RA 7687 Scholarship for students whose families\' socio-economic status does not exceed DOST\'s set values. Scholars may study at state colleges like DNSC.\",\"benefits\":[\"Tuition and other school fees: actual fees up to \\u20b140,000 a year (for scholars in private schools)\",\"Learning materials and \\/ or connectivity allowance: \\u20b110,000 a year\",\"Monthly living allowance: \\u20b18,000 a month\",\"Clothing allowance: \\u20b11,000 (first semester of first year only)\",\"Transportation: one economy-class round trip a year, if you study outside your home province\",\"Group accident and health insurance\",\"Thesis allowance: \\u20b110,000\",\"Research dissemination grant: up to \\u20b150,000 (applied for by the scholar, subject to approval)\",\"Graduation allowance: \\u20b11,000\",\"Mid-year term, if your curriculum requires it: fees up to \\u20b110,000, \\u20b12,000 learning materials, and \\u20b18,000 a month\"],\"documents\":[\"Form C \\u2013 Certificate of Good Moral Character\",\"Form D \\u2013 Certificate of Good Health\",\"Form E \\u2013 Principal\'s Certification: E1 Grade 12 STEM strand; E2 Grade 12 non-STEM strand in the upper 5% of the class; E3 homeschool; E4 Alternative Learning System\",\"Form F \\u2013 Certificate of Residency\",\"Form G \\u2013 Parent\'s Certification that you have no pending immigration application to another country\",\"Form H \\u2013 DOST-SEI Scholarship Examination \\/ Award\",\"Form I \\u2013 Applicant\'s Certification of No Post-Secondary Units\",\"Form J \\u2013 Signed Declaration of Applicant and Parent \\/ Legal Guardian\",\"Recent passport-size picture (4.5 cm \\u00d7 3.5 cm)\",\"Birth certificate\",\"One proof of income of your parents, guardian or spouse: 2024 Income Tax Return; BIR Form 1701; OFW employment contract; BIR Certificate of Exemption from Filing of ITR; Certificate of Indigency; Certificate of Employment with Compensation; or proof of pension\",\"Notarized Affidavit of Guardianship, if applicable\",\"Marriage certificate, if married\"],\"application_route\":\"Apply online through the DOST-SEI scholarship site (science-scholarships.ph), where the forms are posted, then take the DOST-SEI Scholarship Examination. Qualifiers enroll in a priority S&T program at the University of the Philippines, a state college such as DNSC, or a private school that is a CHED Center of Excellence \\/ Development or has FAAP Level III accreditation.\",\"window_note\":\"For Grade 12 students graduating in SY 2025\\u20132026, and earlier Grade 12 graduates not yet enrolled in college. Watch science-scholarships.ph for the call and exam schedule.\",\"rules\":[{\"key\":\"citizen\",\"label\":\"Natural-born Filipino citizen\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"citizenship\",\"value\":\"filipino\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":2,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"incoming\",\"label\":\"Graduating from Grade 12, or a Grade 12 graduate not yet enrolled in college\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"enrollment_status\",\"value\":\"incoming_first_year\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":3,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"strand\",\"label\":\"STEM strand graduate, or in the top 5% of a non-STEM graduating class\",\"type\":\"maybe_in\",\"fact\":\"shs_strand\",\"pass\":[\"stem\"],\"maybe\":[\"abm\",\"humss\",\"gas\",\"tvl\",\"arts_design\",\"sports\",\"als\",\"other\"],\"required\":true,\"weight\":3,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"course\",\"label\":\"Enrolling in a DOST-SEI priority S&T program\",\"type\":\"program_in\",\"fact\":\"program_name\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":5,\"src\":\"web\",\"pass\":[\"Bachelor of Science in Agro-Forestry\",\"Bachelor of Science in Fisheries and Aquatic Sciences\",\"Bachelor of Science in Food Technology\",\"Bachelor of Science in Information Systems\",\"Bachelor of Science in Information Technology\",\"Bachelor of Science in Marine Biology\",\"Bachelor of Secondary Education - Mathematics\",\"Bachelor of Secondary Education - Science\"],\"maybe\":[\"Bachelor of Technology and Livelihood Education\"],\"not\":[\"Bachelor of Arts in Communication\",\"Bachelor of Physical Education\",\"Bachelor of Public Administration\",\"Bachelor of Science in Criminology\",\"Bachelor of Science in Disaster Resilience and Management\",\"Bachelor of Science in Entrepreneurship\",\"Bachelor of Science in Social Work\",\"Bachelor of Science in Tourism Management\",\"Bachelor of Secondary Education - English\"]},{\"key\":\"no_units\",\"label\":\"Has not earned any post-secondary (college or vocational) units\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"previous_units\",\"value\":\"no\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":2,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"exam\",\"label\":\"DOST-SEI Scholarship Examination taken or passed (selection is by this exam)\",\"type\":\"in\",\"fact\":\"dost_exam\",\"value\":[\"taken_waiting\",\"passed\"],\"required\":false,\"weight\":3,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"ra7687\",\"label\":\"RA 7687 track only: family income within DOST\'s set values, and living in your municipality for at least 4 years\",\"type\":\"confirm\",\"fact\":\"income_max\",\"required\":false,\"weight\":1,\"src\":\"web\",\"confirm_note\":\"The Merit track has no income or residency requirement. For RA 7687, DOST-SEI checks your proof of income and your barangay\'s certificate of residency.\"}]}',1,'2026-11-18 22:52:08'),
(6,12,NULL,'{\"official_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/DNSCScholarshipAndFinancialGrants\",\"overview\":\"A LANDBANK scholarship for children and grandchildren of agrarian reform beneficiaries and small farmers \\/ fishers in Davao del Norte, in four agriculture- and technology-related DNSC programs. At DNSC it has a special application for qualified third- and fourth-year regular students; the regular application is for incoming first-year students.\",\"benefits\":[\"The call does not state the benefit amounts. Ask the DNSC Scholarship Office or LANDBANK (iskolarnglandbank@landbankfoundation.com).\"],\"documents\":[\"Duly filled-out and signed ILP Application Form\",\"Special application (3rd \\/ 4th year): certified true copy of grades from first year college to the latest available grades\",\"Special application: letter of recommendation from the College Dean\",\"Special application: Certificate of Good Moral Character from the College OSAS\",\"Regular application (incoming first year): certified true copy of grades 11\\u201312 with school seal, letter of recommendation from the school principal, and Certificate of Good Moral Character from the senior high school\'s Office of Student Affairs\",\"Endorsement letter from a LANDBANK agriculture-related client cooperative, organization, partner SUC or other government agency\",\"PSA \\/ NSO original birth certificate\",\"Proof of registration in the Registry System for Basic Sectors in Agriculture (RSBSA), or a certification from the Municipal Agriculture Office (MAO), the Municipal Agrarian Reform Office (MARO) or the DA \\/ DAR office\",\"Photocopy of the recent ITR of your parents, a BIR Certificate of Tax Exemption, or a Certificate of Indigency\",\"Barangay Clearance from your home barangay\",\"Medical Certificate\",\"Certification of non-enjoyment of other government scholarships\",\"Pre-recorded video (3 minutes at most) introducing yourself and answering: \\\"Why am I pursuing my chosen course?\\\" and \\\"How do I see myself for nation building?\\\" (e-mail it to iskolarnglandbank@landbankfoundation.com)\"],\"application_route\":\"Submit the signed ILP Application Form and the supporting documents to the DNSC Scholarship Office, and e-mail the video to iskolarnglandbank@landbankfoundation.com.\",\"window_note\":\"DNSC deadline for the current call: October 30, 2026.\",\"rules\":[{\"key\":\"course\",\"label\":\"Enrolled in an eligible course: BS Fisheries and Aquatic Sciences, BS Food Technology, BS Agroforestry or BS Information Technology\",\"type\":\"program_in\",\"fact\":\"program_name\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":5,\"src\":\"web\",\"pass\":[\"Bachelor of Science in Fisheries and Aquatic Sciences\",\"Bachelor of Science in Food Technology\",\"Bachelor of Science in Agro-Forestry\",\"Bachelor of Science in Information Technology\"],\"maybe\":[],\"not\":[\"Bachelor of Arts in Communication\",\"Bachelor of Physical Education\",\"Bachelor of Public Administration\",\"Bachelor of Science in Criminology\",\"Bachelor of Science in Disaster Resilience and Management\",\"Bachelor of Science in Entrepreneurship\",\"Bachelor of Science in Information Systems\",\"Bachelor of Science in Marine Biology\",\"Bachelor of Science in Social Work\",\"Bachelor of Science in Tourism Management\",\"Bachelor of Secondary Education - English\",\"Bachelor of Secondary Education - Mathematics\",\"Bachelor of Secondary Education - Science\",\"Bachelor of Technology and Livelihood Education\"]},{\"key\":\"year\",\"label\":\"Incoming first-year student (regular application), or a third- or fourth-year regular student (special application)\",\"type\":\"any_of\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":3,\"src\":\"web\",\"rules\":[{\"key\":\"incoming\",\"label\":\"Incoming first-year student\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"enrollment_status\",\"value\":\"incoming_first_year\"},{\"key\":\"upper\",\"label\":\"Third- or fourth-year student\",\"type\":\"in\",\"fact\":\"year_level\",\"value\":[3,4]}]},{\"key\":\"family\",\"label\":\"Child or grandchild of an Agrarian Reform Beneficiary (ARB) or a small farmer \\/ fisher registered in the RSBSA\",\"type\":\"contains_any\",\"fact\":\"farm_fisher_family\",\"value\":[\"rsbsa\"],\"required\":true,\"weight\":5,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"income\",\"label\":\"Total annual family income of \\u20b1300,000 or less\",\"type\":\"income_lte\",\"fact\":\"income\",\"value\":300000,\"required\":true,\"weight\":4,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"none_other\",\"label\":\"Not receiving any other financial assistance, grant or scholarship\",\"type\":\"contains_none\",\"fact\":\"existing_assistance\",\"value\":[\"tes_tdp_ched\",\"other_government\",\"private_foundation\",\"dnsc_internal\"],\"required\":true,\"weight\":3,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"no_fail\",\"label\":\"No conditional or failing grades\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"failing_grade\",\"value\":\"no\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":2,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"resident\",\"label\":\"Resident of Davao del Norte\",\"type\":\"confirm\",\"fact\":\"dnsc_student\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":2,\"src\":\"web\",\"confirm_note\":\"BAKR does not ask where you live. You show it with your Barangay Clearance.\"},{\"key\":\"standing\",\"label\":\"Special application: a regular student in good academic standing\",\"type\":\"confirm\",\"fact\":\"dnsc_student\",\"required\":false,\"weight\":1,\"src\":\"web\",\"confirm_note\":\"Your certified grades and the College Dean\'s recommendation show this.\",\"skip_if\":{\"enrollment_status\":\"incoming_first_year\"}}],\"application_closes_on\":\"2026-10-30\"}','{\"official_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/DNSCScholarshipAndFinancialGrants\",\"overview\":\"A LANDBANK scholarship for children and grandchildren of agrarian reform beneficiaries and small farmers \\/ fishers in Davao del Norte, in four agriculture- and technology-related DNSC programs. At DNSC it has a special application for qualified third- and fourth-year regular students; the regular application is for incoming first-year students.\",\"benefits\":[\"The call does not state the benefit amounts. Ask the DNSC Scholarship Office or LANDBANK (iskolarnglandbank@landbankfoundation.com).\"],\"documents\":[\"Duly filled-out and signed ILP Application Form\",\"Special application (3rd \\/ 4th year): certified true copy of grades from first year college to the latest available grades\",\"Special application: letter of recommendation from the College Dean\",\"Special application: Certificate of Good Moral Character from the College OSAS\",\"Regular application (incoming first year): certified true copy of grades 11\\u201312 with school seal, letter of recommendation from the school principal, and Certificate of Good Moral Character from the senior high school\'s Office of Student Affairs\",\"Endorsement letter from a LANDBANK agriculture-related client cooperative, organization, partner SUC or other government agency\",\"PSA \\/ NSO original birth certificate\",\"Proof of registration in the Registry System for Basic Sectors in Agriculture (RSBSA), or a certification from the Municipal Agriculture Office (MAO), the Municipal Agrarian Reform Office (MARO) or the DA \\/ DAR office\",\"Photocopy of the recent ITR of your parents, a BIR Certificate of Tax Exemption, or a Certificate of Indigency\",\"Barangay Clearance from your home barangay\",\"Medical Certificate\",\"Certification of non-enjoyment of other government scholarships\",\"Pre-recorded video (3 minutes at most) introducing yourself and answering: \\\"Why am I pursuing my chosen course?\\\" and \\\"How do I see myself for nation building?\\\" (e-mail it to iskolarnglandbank@landbankfoundation.com)\"],\"application_route\":\"Submit the signed ILP Application Form and the supporting documents to the DNSC Scholarship Office, and e-mail the video to iskolarnglandbank@landbankfoundation.com.\",\"window_note\":\"DNSC deadline for the current call: October 30, 2026.\",\"rules\":[{\"key\":\"course\",\"label\":\"Enrolled in an eligible course: BS Fisheries and Aquatic Sciences, BS Food Technology, BS Agroforestry or BS Information Technology\",\"type\":\"program_in\",\"fact\":\"program_name\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":5,\"src\":\"web\",\"pass\":[\"Bachelor of Science in Fisheries and Aquatic Sciences\",\"Bachelor of Science in Food Technology\",\"Bachelor of Science in Agro-Forestry\",\"Bachelor of Science in Information Technology\"],\"maybe\":[],\"not\":[\"Bachelor of Arts in Communication\",\"Bachelor of Physical Education\",\"Bachelor of Public Administration\",\"Bachelor of Science in Criminology\",\"Bachelor of Science in Disaster Resilience and Management\",\"Bachelor of Science in Entrepreneurship\",\"Bachelor of Science in Information Systems\",\"Bachelor of Science in Marine Biology\",\"Bachelor of Science in Social Work\",\"Bachelor of Science in Tourism Management\",\"Bachelor of Secondary Education - English\",\"Bachelor of Secondary Education - Mathematics\",\"Bachelor of Secondary Education - Science\",\"Bachelor of Technology and Livelihood Education\"]},{\"key\":\"year\",\"label\":\"Incoming first-year student (regular application), or a third- or fourth-year regular student (special application)\",\"type\":\"any_of\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":3,\"src\":\"web\",\"rules\":[{\"key\":\"incoming\",\"label\":\"Incoming first-year student\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"enrollment_status\",\"value\":\"incoming_first_year\"},{\"key\":\"upper\",\"label\":\"Third- or fourth-year student\",\"type\":\"in\",\"fact\":\"year_level\",\"value\":[3,4]}]},{\"key\":\"family\",\"label\":\"Child or grandchild of an Agrarian Reform Beneficiary (ARB) or a small farmer \\/ fisher registered in the RSBSA\",\"type\":\"contains_any\",\"fact\":\"farm_fisher_family\",\"value\":[\"rsbsa\"],\"required\":true,\"weight\":5,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"income\",\"label\":\"Total annual family income of \\u20b1300,000 or less\",\"type\":\"income_lte\",\"fact\":\"income\",\"value\":300000,\"required\":true,\"weight\":4,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"none_other\",\"label\":\"Not receiving any other financial assistance, grant or scholarship\",\"type\":\"contains_none\",\"fact\":\"existing_assistance\",\"value\":[\"tes_tdp_ched\",\"other_government\",\"private_foundation\",\"dnsc_internal\"],\"required\":true,\"weight\":3,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"no_fail\",\"label\":\"No conditional or failing grades\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"failing_grade\",\"value\":\"no\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":2,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"resident\",\"label\":\"Resident of Davao del Norte\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"lives_in_davao_del_norte\",\"value\":\"yes\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":2,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"standing\",\"label\":\"Special application: a regular student in good academic standing\",\"type\":\"confirm\",\"fact\":\"dnsc_student\",\"required\":false,\"weight\":1,\"src\":\"web\",\"confirm_note\":\"Your certified grades and the College Dean\'s recommendation show this.\",\"skip_if\":{\"enrollment_status\":\"incoming_first_year\"}}],\"application_closes_on\":\"2026-10-30\"}',1,'2026-11-18 22:52:09'),
(7,14,NULL,'{\"official_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.bfar.da.gov.ph\\/opportunities\\/scholarship\\/\",\"overview\":\"A full college scholarship from the Bureau of Fisheries and Aquatic Resources (BFAR) for qualified high school graduates taking a Bachelor of Science in Fisheries. Three components: the Fisheries Industry Leader Grant (FILG) for senior high school graduates with honors; the Fisherfolk Children Educational Grant (FCEG) for children of registered municipal fisherfolk; and FSP-ICCs\\/IPs for poor but deserving members of Indigenous Cultural Communities \\/ Indigenous Peoples recognized by the NCIP.\",\"benefits\":[\"A full scholarship grant for college studies leading to the degree of Bachelor of Science in Fisheries\",\"Free matriculation and other school fees, except the dormitory fee\",\"Monthly stipend: \\u20b15,000\",\"Semestral book allowance: \\u20b12,000\",\"OJT support: \\u20b13,000\",\"Research \\/ thesis \\/ special problem support: \\u20b17,000\",\"Graduation support: \\u20b11,500\",\"Amounts above are from the FCEG application form; check the FILG and ICC\\/IP forms for theirs\"],\"documents\":[\"Duly accomplished and signed FSP application form for your component (FILG, FCEG or ICCs\\/IPs, downloadable from the BFAR website)\",\"Original or certified true copy of your birth certificate (PSA or Civil Registrar)\",\"Certified true copy of Report Card Form 138 or 137 (GWA of the last 3 semesters of senior high school of at least 80%)\",\"Certification of good moral character from the School Registrar\",\"FCEG: photocopy of the Fish-R \\/ Mangingisdang Juan ID or Certificate of Registration of your parent(s) or guardian(s), issued by the MAO or BFAR\",\"Two recent 2x2 pictures taken within the last three months, colored, white background (phone photos may be allowed)\",\"Barangay Residence Certificate of your parent(s) or guardian(s)\",\"In case of guardianship: affidavit of the guardian that you have been his \\/ her ward for at least five years\"],\"application_route\":\"Download the application form for your component from the BFAR scholarship page, submit it with the documents to the BFAR Regional Office (BFAR XI for Davao), then take the FSP examination (bring 2 pencils, a valid ID and your admission slip; the exam starts at 8:00 AM).\",\"window_note\":\"The BFAR page gives no application dates. Ask the BFAR Regional Office for the current examination schedule.\",\"rules\":[{\"key\":\"citizen\",\"label\":\"Natural-born Filipino citizen\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"citizenship\",\"value\":\"filipino\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":2,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"incoming\",\"label\":\"Senior high school graduate or graduating student, not yet in college\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"enrollment_status\",\"value\":\"incoming_first_year\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":3,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"no_units\",\"label\":\"Has not earned any units in college\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"previous_units\",\"value\":\"no\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":2,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"gwa\",\"label\":\"Senior high school GWA (last 3 semesters) of at least 80%\",\"type\":\"gte\",\"fact\":\"shs_gwa_percent\",\"value\":80,\"required\":true,\"weight\":4,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"component\",\"label\":\"Fits a component: child of a registered municipal fisherfolk (FCEG), member of an Indigenous Cultural Community \\/ Indigenous Peoples group (ICCs\\/IPs), or graduating with honors (FILG)\",\"type\":\"any_of\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":5,\"src\":\"web\",\"rules\":[{\"key\":\"fishr\",\"label\":\"Parent or guardian is a registered municipal fisherfolk (FishR)\",\"type\":\"contains_any\",\"fact\":\"farm_fisher_family\",\"value\":[\"fishr\"]},{\"key\":\"ip\",\"label\":\"Member of an Indigenous Peoples group\",\"type\":\"contains_any\",\"fact\":\"special_groups\",\"value\":[\"indigenous_people\"]},{\"key\":\"honors\",\"label\":\"Graduating with honors (DepEd: GWA of 90 or higher)\",\"type\":\"gte\",\"fact\":\"shs_gwa_percent\",\"value\":90}]},{\"key\":\"course\",\"label\":\"Taking a Bachelor of Science in Fisheries\",\"type\":\"program_in\",\"fact\":\"program_name\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":5,\"src\":\"web\",\"pass\":[],\"maybe\":[\"Bachelor of Science in Fisheries and Aquatic Sciences\"],\"not\":[\"Bachelor of Arts in Communication\",\"Bachelor of Physical Education\",\"Bachelor of Public Administration\",\"Bachelor of Science in Agro-Forestry\",\"Bachelor of Science in Criminology\",\"Bachelor of Science in Disaster Resilience and Management\",\"Bachelor of Science in Entrepreneurship\",\"Bachelor of Science in Food Technology\",\"Bachelor of Science in Information Systems\",\"Bachelor of Science in Information Technology\",\"Bachelor of Science in Marine Biology\",\"Bachelor of Science in Social Work\",\"Bachelor of Science in Tourism Management\",\"Bachelor of Secondary Education - English\",\"Bachelor of Secondary Education - Mathematics\",\"Bachelor of Secondary Education - Science\",\"Bachelor of Technology and Livelihood Education\"]},{\"key\":\"conduct\",\"label\":\"Of good moral character, certified by the school head or principal\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"disciplinary\",\"value\":\"no\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":2,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"age\",\"label\":\"Not more than 25 years old at the time of the examination\",\"type\":\"confirm\",\"fact\":\"dnsc_student\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":1,\"src\":\"web\",\"confirm_note\":\"BAKR does not ask your age. Your birth certificate shows it.\"},{\"key\":\"residence\",\"label\":\"You or your parent \\/ guardian have lived for at least 6 months in a municipality of the region where the slot is allotted\",\"type\":\"confirm\",\"fact\":\"dnsc_student\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":1,\"src\":\"web\",\"confirm_note\":\"Shown by the Barangay Residence Certificate. Ask BFAR XI which municipalities have slots.\"}]}','{\"official_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.bfar.da.gov.ph\\/opportunities\\/scholarship\\/\",\"overview\":\"A full college scholarship from the Bureau of Fisheries and Aquatic Resources (BFAR) for qualified high school graduates taking a Bachelor of Science in Fisheries. Three components: the Fisheries Industry Leader Grant (FILG) for senior high school graduates with honors; the Fisherfolk Children Educational Grant (FCEG) for children of registered municipal fisherfolk; and FSP-ICCs\\/IPs for poor but deserving members of Indigenous Cultural Communities \\/ Indigenous Peoples recognized by the NCIP.\",\"benefits\":[\"A full scholarship grant for college studies leading to the degree of Bachelor of Science in Fisheries\",\"Free matriculation and other school fees, except the dormitory fee\",\"Monthly stipend: \\u20b15,000\",\"Semestral book allowance: \\u20b12,000\",\"OJT support: \\u20b13,000\",\"Research \\/ thesis \\/ special problem support: \\u20b17,000\",\"Graduation support: \\u20b11,500\",\"Amounts above are from the FCEG application form; check the FILG and ICC\\/IP forms for theirs\"],\"documents\":[\"Duly accomplished and signed FSP application form for your component (FILG, FCEG or ICCs\\/IPs, downloadable from the BFAR website)\",\"Original or certified true copy of your birth certificate (PSA or Civil Registrar)\",\"Certified true copy of Report Card Form 138 or 137 (GWA of the last 3 semesters of senior high school of at least 80%)\",\"Certification of good moral character from the School Registrar\",\"FCEG: photocopy of the Fish-R \\/ Mangingisdang Juan ID or Certificate of Registration of your parent(s) or guardian(s), issued by the MAO or BFAR\",\"Two recent 2x2 pictures taken within the last three months, colored, white background (phone photos may be allowed)\",\"Barangay Residence Certificate of your parent(s) or guardian(s)\",\"In case of guardianship: affidavit of the guardian that you have been his \\/ her ward for at least five years\"],\"application_route\":\"Download the application form for your component from the BFAR scholarship page, submit it with the documents to the BFAR Regional Office (BFAR XI for Davao), then take the FSP examination (bring 2 pencils, a valid ID and your admission slip; the exam starts at 8:00 AM).\",\"window_note\":\"The BFAR page gives no application dates. Ask the BFAR Regional Office for the current examination schedule.\",\"rules\":[{\"key\":\"citizen\",\"label\":\"Natural-born Filipino citizen\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"citizenship\",\"value\":\"filipino\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":2,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"incoming\",\"label\":\"Senior high school graduate or graduating student, not yet in college\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"enrollment_status\",\"value\":\"incoming_first_year\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":3,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"no_units\",\"label\":\"Has not earned any units in college\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"previous_units\",\"value\":\"no\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":2,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"gwa\",\"label\":\"Senior high school GWA (last 3 semesters) of at least 80%\",\"type\":\"gte\",\"fact\":\"shs_gwa_percent\",\"value\":80,\"required\":true,\"weight\":4,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"component\",\"label\":\"Fits a component: child of a registered municipal fisherfolk (FCEG), member of an Indigenous Cultural Community \\/ Indigenous Peoples group (ICCs\\/IPs), or graduating with honors (FILG)\",\"type\":\"any_of\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":5,\"src\":\"web\",\"rules\":[{\"key\":\"fishr\",\"label\":\"Parent or guardian is a registered municipal fisherfolk (FishR)\",\"type\":\"contains_any\",\"fact\":\"farm_fisher_family\",\"value\":[\"fishr\"]},{\"key\":\"ip\",\"label\":\"Member of an Indigenous Peoples group\",\"type\":\"contains_any\",\"fact\":\"special_groups\",\"value\":[\"indigenous_people\"]},{\"key\":\"honors\",\"label\":\"Graduating with honors (DepEd: GWA of 90 or higher)\",\"type\":\"gte\",\"fact\":\"shs_gwa_percent\",\"value\":90}]},{\"key\":\"course\",\"label\":\"Taking a Bachelor of Science in Fisheries\",\"type\":\"program_in\",\"fact\":\"program_name\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":5,\"src\":\"web\",\"pass\":[],\"maybe\":[\"Bachelor of Science in Fisheries and Aquatic Sciences\"],\"not\":[\"Bachelor of Arts in Communication\",\"Bachelor of Physical Education\",\"Bachelor of Public Administration\",\"Bachelor of Science in Agro-Forestry\",\"Bachelor of Science in Criminology\",\"Bachelor of Science in Disaster Resilience and Management\",\"Bachelor of Science in Entrepreneurship\",\"Bachelor of Science in Food Technology\",\"Bachelor of Science in Information Systems\",\"Bachelor of Science in Information Technology\",\"Bachelor of Science in Marine Biology\",\"Bachelor of Science in Social Work\",\"Bachelor of Science in Tourism Management\",\"Bachelor of Secondary Education - English\",\"Bachelor of Secondary Education - Mathematics\",\"Bachelor of Secondary Education - Science\",\"Bachelor of Technology and Livelihood Education\"]},{\"key\":\"conduct\",\"label\":\"Of good moral character, certified by the school head or principal\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"disciplinary\",\"value\":\"no\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":2,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"age\",\"label\":\"Not more than 25 years old at the time of the examination\",\"type\":\"lte\",\"fact\":\"age\",\"value\":25,\"required\":true,\"weight\":1,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"residence\",\"label\":\"You or your parent \\/ guardian have lived for at least 6 months in a municipality of the region where the slot is allotted\",\"type\":\"confirm\",\"fact\":\"dnsc_student\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":1,\"src\":\"web\",\"confirm_note\":\"Shown by the Barangay Residence Certificate. Ask BFAR XI which municipalities have slots.\"}]}',1,'2026-11-18 22:52:09'),
(8,7,2,'{\"overview\":\"A DOST-SEI scholarship for talented Filipino students entering priority Science and Technology programs. Two tracks: the Merit Scholarship (formerly NSDB \\/ NSTA) for students with high aptitude in science and mathematics, and the RA 7687 Scholarship for students whose families\' socio-economic status does not exceed DOST\'s set values. Scholars may study at state colleges like DNSC.\",\"benefits\":[\"Tuition and other school fees: actual fees up to \\u20b140,000 a year (for scholars in private schools)\",\"Learning materials and \\/ or connectivity allowance: \\u20b110,000 a year\",\"Monthly living allowance: \\u20b18,000 a month\",\"Clothing allowance: \\u20b11,000 (first semester of first year only)\",\"Transportation: one economy-class round trip a year, if you study outside your home province\",\"Group accident and health insurance\",\"Thesis allowance: \\u20b110,000\",\"Research dissemination grant: up to \\u20b150,000 (applied for by the scholar, subject to approval)\",\"Graduation allowance: \\u20b11,000\",\"Mid-year term, if your curriculum requires it: fees up to \\u20b110,000, \\u20b12,000 learning materials, and \\u20b18,000 a month\"],\"documents\":[\"Form C \\u2013 Certificate of Good Moral Character\",\"Form D \\u2013 Certificate of Good Health\",\"Form E \\u2013 Principal\'s Certification: E1 Grade 12 STEM strand; E2 Grade 12 non-STEM strand in the upper 5% of the class; E3 homeschool; E4 Alternative Learning System\",\"Form F \\u2013 Certificate of Residency\",\"Form G \\u2013 Parent\'s Certification that you have no pending immigration application to another country\",\"Form H \\u2013 DOST-SEI Scholarship Examination \\/ Award\",\"Form I \\u2013 Applicant\'s Certification of No Post-Secondary Units\",\"Form J \\u2013 Signed Declaration of Applicant and Parent \\/ Legal Guardian\",\"Recent passport-size picture (4.5 cm \\u00d7 3.5 cm)\",\"Birth certificate\",\"One proof of income of your parents, guardian or spouse: 2024 Income Tax Return; BIR Form 1701; OFW employment contract; BIR Certificate of Exemption from Filing of ITR; Certificate of Indigency; Certificate of Employment with Compensation; or proof of pension\",\"Notarized Affidavit of Guardianship, if applicable\",\"Marriage certificate, if married\"],\"renewal_requirements\":[{\"name\":\"Certificate of Registration\",\"note\":\"From the registrar\",\"types\":[\"pdf\",\"jpg\",\"png\"],\"max_mb\":5,\"required\":true},{\"name\":\"Certificate of Grades\",\"note\":\"Grades from the previous semester\",\"types\":[\"pdf\",\"jpg\",\"png\"],\"max_mb\":5,\"required\":true}],\"application_route\":\"Apply online through the DOST-SEI scholarship site (science-scholarships.ph), where the forms are posted, then take the DOST-SEI Scholarship Examination. Qualifiers enroll in a priority S&T program at the University of the Philippines, a state college such as DNSC, or a private school that is a CHED Center of Excellence \\/ Development or has FAAP Level III accreditation.\",\"window_note\":\"For Grade 12 students graduating in SY 2025\\u20132026, and earlier Grade 12 graduates not yet enrolled in college. Watch science-scholarships.ph for the call and exam schedule.\",\"application_opens_on\":null,\"application_closes_on\":null,\"results_on\":null,\"official_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.science-scholarships.ph\\/\",\"rules\":[{\"key\":\"citizen\",\"label\":\"Natural-born Filipino citizen\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"citizenship\",\"value\":\"filipino\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":2,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"incoming\",\"label\":\"Graduating from Grade 12, or a Grade 12 graduate not yet enrolled in college\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"enrollment_status\",\"value\":\"incoming_first_year\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":3,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"strand\",\"label\":\"STEM strand graduate, or in the top 5% of a non-STEM graduating class\",\"type\":\"maybe_in\",\"fact\":\"shs_strand\",\"pass\":[\"stem\"],\"maybe\":[\"abm\",\"humss\",\"gas\",\"tvl\",\"arts_design\",\"sports\",\"als\",\"other\"],\"required\":true,\"weight\":3,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"course\",\"label\":\"Enrolling in a DOST-SEI priority S&T program\",\"type\":\"program_in\",\"fact\":\"program_name\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":5,\"src\":\"web\",\"pass\":[\"Bachelor of Science in Agro-Forestry\",\"Bachelor of Science in Fisheries and Aquatic Sciences\",\"Bachelor of Science in Food Technology\",\"Bachelor of Science in Information Systems\",\"Bachelor of Science in Information Technology\",\"Bachelor of Science in Marine Biology\",\"Bachelor of Secondary Education - Mathematics\",\"Bachelor of Secondary Education - Science\"],\"maybe\":[\"Bachelor of Technology and Livelihood Education\"],\"not\":[\"Bachelor of Arts in Communication\",\"Bachelor of Physical Education\",\"Bachelor of Public Administration\",\"Bachelor of Science in Criminology\",\"Bachelor of Science in Disaster Resilience and Management\",\"Bachelor of Science in Entrepreneurship\",\"Bachelor of Science in Social Work\",\"Bachelor of Science in Tourism Management\",\"Bachelor of Secondary Education - English\"]},{\"key\":\"no_units\",\"label\":\"Has not earned any post-secondary (college or vocational) units\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"previous_units\",\"value\":\"no\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":2,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"exam\",\"label\":\"DOST-SEI Scholarship Examination taken or passed (selection is by this exam)\",\"type\":\"in\",\"fact\":\"dost_exam\",\"value\":[\"taken_waiting\",\"passed\"],\"required\":false,\"weight\":3,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"ra7687\",\"label\":\"RA 7687 track only: family income within DOST\'s set values, and living in your municipality for at least 4 years\",\"type\":\"confirm\",\"fact\":\"income_max\",\"required\":false,\"weight\":1,\"src\":\"web\",\"confirm_note\":\"The Merit track has no income or residency requirement. For RA 7687, DOST-SEI checks your proof of income and your barangay\'s certificate of residency.\"}]}','{\"overview\":\"A DOST-SEI scholarship for talented Filipino students entering priority Science and Technology programs. Two tracks: the Merit Scholarship (formerly NSDB \\/ NSTA) for students with high aptitude in science and mathematics, and the RA 7687 Scholarship for students whose families\' socio-economic status does not exceed DOST\'s set values. Scholars may study at state colleges like DNSC.\",\"benefits\":[\"Tuition and other school fees: actual fees up to \\u20b140,000 a year (for scholars in private schools)\",\"Learning materials and \\/ or connectivity allowance: \\u20b110,000 a year\",\"Monthly living allowance: \\u20b18,000 a month\",\"Clothing allowance: \\u20b11,000 (first semester of first year only)\",\"Transportation: one economy-class round trip a year, if you study outside your home province\",\"Group accident and health insurance\",\"Thesis allowance: \\u20b110,000\",\"Research dissemination grant: up to \\u20b150,000 (applied for by the scholar, subject to approval)\",\"Graduation allowance: \\u20b11,000\",\"Mid-year term, if your curriculum requires it: fees up to \\u20b110,000, \\u20b12,000 learning materials, and \\u20b18,000 a month\"],\"documents\":[\"Form C \\u2013 Certificate of Good Moral Character\",\"Form D \\u2013 Certificate of Good Health\",\"Form E \\u2013 Principal\'s Certification: E1 Grade 12 STEM strand; E2 Grade 12 non-STEM strand in the upper 5% of the class; E3 homeschool; E4 Alternative Learning System\",\"Form F \\u2013 Certificate of Residency\",\"Form G \\u2013 Parent\'s Certification that you have no pending immigration application to another country\",\"Form H \\u2013 DOST-SEI Scholarship Examination \\/ Award\",\"Form I \\u2013 Applicant\'s Certification of No Post-Secondary Units\",\"Form J \\u2013 Signed Declaration of Applicant and Parent \\/ Legal Guardian\",\"Recent passport-size picture (4.5 cm \\u00d7 3.5 cm)\",\"Birth certificate\",\"One proof of income of your parents, guardian or spouse: 2024 Income Tax Return; BIR Form 1701; OFW employment contract; BIR Certificate of Exemption from Filing of ITR; Certificate of Indigency; Certificate of Employment with Compensation; or proof of pension\",\"Notarized Affidavit of Guardianship, if applicable\",\"Marriage certificate, if married\"],\"renewal_requirements\":[{\"name\":\"Certificate of Registration\",\"note\":\"From the registrar\",\"types\":[\"pdf\",\"jpg\",\"png\"],\"max_mb\":5,\"required\":true},{\"name\":\"Certificate of Grades\",\"note\":\"Grades from the previous semester\",\"types\":[\"pdf\",\"jpg\",\"png\"],\"max_mb\":5,\"required\":true},{\"name\":\"Photocopy of oten\",\"note\":\"wowowow\",\"types\":[\"pdf\",\"jpg\",\"png\"],\"max_mb\":5,\"required\":true}],\"application_route\":\"Apply online through the DOST-SEI scholarship site (science-scholarships.ph), where the forms are posted, then take the DOST-SEI Scholarship Examination. Qualifiers enroll in a priority S&T program at the University of the Philippines, a state college such as DNSC, or a private school that is a CHED Center of Excellence \\/ Development or has FAAP Level III accreditation.\",\"window_note\":\"For Grade 12 students graduating in SY 2025\\u20132026, and earlier Grade 12 graduates not yet enrolled in college. Watch science-scholarships.ph for the call and exam schedule.\",\"application_opens_on\":null,\"application_closes_on\":null,\"results_on\":null,\"official_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.science-scholarships.ph\\/\",\"rules\":[{\"key\":\"citizen\",\"label\":\"Natural-born Filipino citizen\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"citizenship\",\"value\":\"filipino\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":2,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"incoming\",\"label\":\"Graduating from Grade 12, or a Grade 12 graduate not yet enrolled in college\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"enrollment_status\",\"value\":\"incoming_first_year\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":3,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"strand\",\"label\":\"STEM strand graduate, or in the top 5% of a non-STEM graduating class\",\"type\":\"maybe_in\",\"fact\":\"shs_strand\",\"pass\":[\"stem\"],\"maybe\":[\"abm\",\"humss\",\"gas\",\"tvl\",\"arts_design\",\"sports\",\"als\",\"other\"],\"required\":true,\"weight\":3,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"course\",\"label\":\"Enrolling in a DOST-SEI priority S&T program\",\"type\":\"program_in\",\"fact\":\"program_name\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":5,\"src\":\"web\",\"pass\":[\"Bachelor of Science in Agro-Forestry\",\"Bachelor of Science in Fisheries and Aquatic Sciences\",\"Bachelor of Science in Food Technology\",\"Bachelor of Science in Information Systems\",\"Bachelor of Science in Information Technology\",\"Bachelor of Science in Marine Biology\",\"Bachelor of Secondary Education - Mathematics\",\"Bachelor of Secondary Education - Science\"],\"maybe\":[\"Bachelor of Technology and Livelihood Education\"],\"not\":[\"Bachelor of Arts in Communication\",\"Bachelor of Physical Education\",\"Bachelor of Public Administration\",\"Bachelor of Science in Criminology\",\"Bachelor of Science in Disaster Resilience and Management\",\"Bachelor of Science in Entrepreneurship\",\"Bachelor of Science in Social Work\",\"Bachelor of Science in Tourism Management\",\"Bachelor of Secondary Education - English\"]},{\"key\":\"no_units\",\"label\":\"Has not earned any post-secondary (college or vocational) units\",\"type\":\"eq\",\"fact\":\"previous_units\",\"value\":\"no\",\"required\":true,\"weight\":2,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"exam\",\"label\":\"DOST-SEI Scholarship Examination taken or passed (selection is by this exam)\",\"type\":\"in\",\"fact\":\"dost_exam\",\"value\":[\"taken_waiting\",\"passed\"],\"required\":false,\"weight\":3,\"src\":\"web\"},{\"key\":\"ra7687\",\"label\":\"RA 7687 track only: family income within DOST\'s set values, and living in your municipality for at least 4 years\",\"type\":\"confirm\",\"fact\":\"income_max\",\"required\":false,\"weight\":1,\"src\":\"web\",\"confirm_note\":\"The Merit track has no income or residency requirement. For RA 7687, DOST-SEI checks your proof of income and your barangay\'s certificate of residency.\"}]}',0,'2026-11-19 06:23:01'),
